-// Multiplies mat with vec, adds add and puts the result in out.
-//
-// mat is a (kOuter, kInner)-shaped array, where element [i,j] is located at
-// index i * kInner + j.
-//
-// vec is a (kInner,)-shaped array.
-//
-// add is a (kOuter,)-shaped array.
